OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors allege Russell Brand was
OL,8,F"ruthless and calculated" as the
OL,9,F51-year-old goes on trial on charges of
OL,10,Frape and sexual assault
OL,12,FOpening the prosecution's case, Riel
OL,13,FKarmy-Jones KC says Brand was
OL,14,F"childlike in his expectation that his
OL,15,Fevery desire should be met" and call
OL,16,Fhim a "sexual predator"
OL,18,FThe comedian and actor has pleaded not
OL,19,Fguilty to three counts of rape, three
OL,20,Fcounts of sexual assault and one count
OL,21,Fof indecent assault
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
