OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALena Dunham's Girls to return for
OL,4,Alimited HBO run
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll five actors, whose careers launched
OL,7,Foff the back of Girls, will be part of
OL,8,Fthe five-episode revival with
OL,9,Fproduction set to begin in 2027. Judd
OL,10,FApatow, who helped get the show green
OL,11,Flit with HBO, will also return as
OL,12,Fexecutive producer.
OL,14,F"We always said we would only return to
OL,15,F'Girls' if there was a specific story
OL,16,Fwe were burning to tell," Dunham said
OL,17,Fin a statement.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
